$ myapp --help
usage: myapp  --input value [--output value] [--niter value] [--tol value] [--verbose] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]

Demonstration program


Required switches:
   --input value, -i value
    Input file

Optional switches:
   --output value, -o value
    default value out.dat
    Output file
   --niter value, -n value
    default value 100
    Iterations
   --tol value, -t value
    default value 1.0e-6
    Tolerance
   --verbose
    default value .false.
    Verbose output
   --help, -h
    Print this help message
   --markdown, -md
    Save this help message in a Markdown file
   --version, -v
    Print version

Examples:
   myapp -i a.dat -o b.dat
   myapp -i a.dat -n 100 --tol 1
